come into contact with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spiders - Enemies will get snatched away by scuttling spiders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rats - A nest of rats appears and creates mayhem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leeches - leech slime slows down enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crows - flock of crows will appear and harass enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Centipedes - Bursts out of the ground and takes out any enemies that are in is path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vines - Vines grow from the ground and across chasms allowing you to move from platform to platform.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918070/extras/ee82a96494d60aa8fc4a526cdb78ab93.webp?t=1739829842\" /></div></p>",
